\"><mn>8</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></math>&nbsp;electrons.</p><p>Statement II : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#960;</mi></math> electrons of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> group in tropolone is involved in aromaticity. In the light of the above statements choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>"}, "options": [{"id": "ee7d39", "text": "Statement I is true but Statement II is false", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f782ee0e063d928aa0d"}, {"id": "9df02e", "text": "Statement I is false but Statement II is true", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f782ee0e063d928aa0e"}, {"id": "748eea", "text": "Both Statement I and Statement II are false", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f782ee0e063d928aa0f"}, {"id": "311767", "text": "Both Statement I and Statement II are true", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f782ee0e063d928aa10"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f782ee0e063d928aa11", "type": "singleCorrect", "chapters": ["60ced3330e34b73944ddfaf4"], "topics": ["60e2fbdc66f9ce3f243b5676"], "concepts": ["6162fbab6ed13040ec851a31"], "question": {"text": "<p>Arrange the following in decreasing acidic strength.</p><p><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/quantrexacademy-app.firebasestorage.app/o/questions%2Ffigs%2Fpyq%2Fjee_main%2F38154ae1-d185-402c-8064-bf95b1ab7499-image.png?alt=media\" style=\"width: 407px; height: 150px;\" /></p>"}, "options": [{"id": "066bd5", "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f782ee0e063d928aa12"}, {"id": "042798", "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"no